;&#2367;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Ophthalmologist</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Ophthalmologist</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Psychiatrist</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Psychiatrist</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Cardiologist</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Cardiologist</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Gastroenterologist</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Gastroenterologist</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Ophthalmologist is an eye-care specialist.</p><p>Psychiatrist is a physician who is specialist in psychiatry.</p><p>Cardiologist is a physician who is an expert in care of heart and blood vessels.</p><p>Gastroenterologist is a physician who is specialist in Stomach.</p><p>Thus, except Psychiatrist all other physicians are related to study of body organs.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">7 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>Three of the following word pairs are alike in some manner and hence form a group. Which word pair does not belong to that group?</p><p>(The words must be considered as meaningful English words and must not be grouped based on the number of letters/number of consonants/vowels in the word.)</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360;&#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>(&#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2332;&#2368; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306;/&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306;/&#2360;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;)</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Television - Triangle</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2335;&#2375;&#2354;&#2368;&#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2364;&#2344; - &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Birthday hat - Cone</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2332;&#2344;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342;&#2367;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2335;&#2379;&#2346;&#2368; - &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Ball - Sphere</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2327;&#2375;&#2306;&#2342; - &#2327;&#2379;&#2354;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Ring - Circle</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2354;&#2351; - &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>On checking each option one by one, we get:-</p><p>1: Television  -  Triangle:</p><p>A television is an electronic device with a rectangular screen, while a triangle is a three-sided shape. Unlike the other pairs, a television is not shaped like a triangle.</p><p>2: Birthday hat  -  Cone:</p><p>A birthday hat is typically cone-shaped, with a circular base and a pointed top. This connects an object to its geometric shape.</p><p>3: Ball  -  Sphere:</p><p>A ball is a round object, and a sphere is the geometric term for that shape. This pair links an object to its shape.</p><p>4: Ring  -  Circle:</p><p>A ring is a circular band, and a circle is a two-dimensional round shape. This also relates an object to its geometric shape.</p><p>So Options 2, 3, and 4 all pair an object with its corresponding shape, while Option 1 (Television  -  Triangle) does not follow this pattern.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><s